        "original_id": "6c2c5886-4082-5aca-88db-ff5df68b09a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lesley Manville, Philip Davis, Brenda Blethyn, Janine Duvitski, Lindsay Duncan, Sam Kelly, Darlington\n- Works: Grown-Ups, 'Allo 'Allo!\n- Organizations: Direct Hit Records\n- Bands: MESS, Bedhead, Baboon, Brutal Juice, UFOFU, Slowpoke, the Grown-Ups, Dooms UK\n- Places: North Texas\n\nFacts:\n- The work \"Grown-Ups\" stars Lesley Manville, Philip Davis, Brenda Blethyn, Janine Duvitski, Lindsay Duncan, and Sam Kelly.\n- Sam Kelly is best known for his role as Captain Hans Geering in \"'Allo 'Allo!\".\n- Direct Hit Records released early recordings by North Texas musicians who later gained national prominence.\n- Direct Hit Records released early recordings by Darlington, as the band MESS, as well as Bedhead, Baboon, Brutal Juice, UFOFU, Slowpoke, the Grown-Ups, and Dooms UK.",
